      <li id="src-3">Zoëga, G.T. (1910). <em>A Concise Dictionary of Old Icelandic</em>. Oxford. (Public domain.) — word glosses.</li>
      <li id="src-4">Larrington, C. (1996). <em>The Poetic Edda</em> (trans.). Oxford University Press. p. 56. — translation and commentary on stanza 20.</li>
      <li id="src-5">Boarman, W.I. & Heinrich, B. (1999). Common Raven (<em>Corvus corax</em>). <em>Birds of the World</em>. Cornell Lab. — raven daily range and behaviour.</li>
    </ol>
